13:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-custom max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["# Email Marketing KPIs: What to Measure and How to Interpret the Data"]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Excerpt:"}]," Open rates, click-through rates, conversion rates, ROI -- which metrics actually matter? This guide explains every key email marketing KPI, what benchmark data tells us, and--most importantly--how to *act* on the numbers."]}],["$","hr","4",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Email marketing remains one of the highest-ROI digital channels available: for every $1 spent, businesses earn an average of ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"$$36 in return"}],", according to the DMA's 2023 Email Marketing Benchmark Report. But that impressive ROI isn't automatic--it's earned through disciplined measurement, interpretation, and optimization. Yet too many marketers track vanity metrics (like open rate alone) while ignoring signals that truly drive revenue."]}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["So which KPIs *actually* matter--and how do you move beyond surface-level reporting to strategic action?"]}],["$","p","10",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Let's break down the five non-negotiable email marketing KPIs--with benchmarks, interpretation frameworks, and concrete next steps."]}],["$","hr","12",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","14",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"1. **Open Rate: The First Impression (But Not the Final Word)**"}],["$","p","15",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["*What it measures:* % of recipients who opened your email (calculated as opens ÷ delivered emails × 100)."]}],["$","p","17",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Benchmark (2024 industry avg):"}],""]}],["$","p","18",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- B2C: ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"19.7%"}]," (Mailchimp)"]}],["$","p","19",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- B2B: ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"15.1%"}]," (HubSpot)"]}],["$","p","21",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["⚠️ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Critical caveat:"}]," Opens are tracked via invisible pixels--and many email clients (e.g., Apple Mail with Privacy Protection) now block them by default. As of 2024, ~43% of iOS users have \"Hide My Email\" enabled, inflating open rates artificially."]}],["$","p","23",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"How to interpret & act:"}],""]}],["$","p","24",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- If your open rate is *below* benchmark: Audit subject lines, sender name consistency, and send timing. A/B test urgency (\"Last chance!\" vs. curiosity-driven \"You asked about X...\")."]}],["$","p","25",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- If it's *above* benchmark but CTR is low: Your subject line is working--but your preview text or content isn't delivering. Fix the disconnect between promise and payoff."]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$