1f:["$","p","39",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"How to interpret & act:"}],""]}]
20:["$","p","40",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Low CTR + high open rate = weak value proposition or unclear CTAs. Test button color, copy (\"Get My Free Guide\" outperforms \"Click Here\" by 21%, per HubSpot), and link placement (top-fold links get 3× more clicks than bottom ones)."]}]
21:["$","p","41",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- High CTR but low conversions? Your landing page is failing--not your email. Ensure message match: if your email says \"50% Off Summer Styles,\" the landing page must display that exact offer *above the fold*."]}]
22:["$","p","42",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Pro tip:"}]," Track *click-to-link ratio* (clicks per unique link) to identify top-performing content. Example: In a newsletter with 5 links, if \"Download Our SEO Checklist\" gets 68% of all clicks, double down on lead-gen assets--not blog roundups."]}]
23:["$","hr","44",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
24:["$","h2","46",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"3. **Conversion Rate**"}]
25:["$","p","47",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["*What it measures:* % of email recipients who completed a desired action (e.g., purchase, sign-up, demo request) *after clicking*. Calculated as conversions ÷ clicks × 100."]}]
26:["$","p","49",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Benchmark:"}],""]}]
27:["$","p","50",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- E-commerce: ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"1.9-3.2%"}]," (SaleCycle)"]}]
28:["$","p","51",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Lead gen: ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"5.2%"}]," (WordStream)"]}]
29:["$","p","53",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"How to interpret & act:"}],""]}]
2a:["$","p","54",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- A 2% conversion rate on a $99 product means ~$2 in revenue per 100 emails sent. Scale that to 100,000 subscribers → $2,000 *per send*. That's actionable."]}]
2b:["$","p","55",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- If conversion rate dips YoY: Audit your segmentation. A campaign sent to \"All Subscribers\" converts at 1.1%; the same offer to \"Cart Abandoners (last 7 days)\" converts at 12.4% (Klaviyo data)."]}]
2c:["$","p","56",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Actionable fix:"}]," Add behavioral triggers. Example: Send a personalized discount *only* to users who viewed pricing but didn't convert--this lifts conversion rates by up to 34% (Barilliance)."]}]
2d:["$","hr","58",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
2e:["$","h2","60",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"4. **Revenue Per Email (RPE)**"}]
2f:["$","p","61",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["*What it measures:* Total revenue generated from an email campaign ÷ number of emails delivered."]}]
30:["$","p","63",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Why it beats \"ROI\" alone:"}]," ROI requires cost inputs (design, tools, labor); RPE isolates email's direct contribution."]}]
31:["$","p","65",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"How to interpret & act:"}],""]}]
32:["$","p","66",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Top-quartile retailers achieve ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"$$0.32+ RPE"}]," (Klaviyo, 2024). If yours is $0.08, diagnose: Are you sending too frequently? Is your average order value (AOV) low?"]}]
33:["$","p","67",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Leverage this stat:"}]," Segment by RPE. One brand found 12% of subscribers drove 68% of email revenue. They launched a VIP program for this cohort--increasing their RPE by 41% in Q3."]}]
34:["$","hr","69",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
35:["$","h2","71",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"5. **List Churn Rate (Unsubscribes + Spam Complaints)**"}]
36:["$","p","72",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["*What it measures:* % of recipients who opted out or marked your email as spam. Industry standard: ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"< 0.2%"}]," is healthy; > 0.5% signals risk."]}]
37:["$","p","74",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"How to interpret & act:"}],""]}]
38:["$","p","75",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- A sudden spike in unsubscribes after a redesign? Your layout may feel aggressive or salesy. Survey leavers: \"What made you unsubscribe?\" (Use a post-unsubscribe page.)"]}]
39:["$","p","76",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Spam complaints > 0.1% can trigger ISP filtering. Clean lists quarterly--remove inactive subscribers (>6 months no opens/clicks). Brands that prune inactive users see ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"22% higher engagement"}]," (Yes Lifecycle Marketing)."]}]
3a:["$","hr","78",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
3b:["$","h2","80",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Bonus: The Metric Most Marketers Ignore -- **Email Sharing Rate**"}]
3c:["$","p","81",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["% of recipients who forward your email or click \"Share on LinkedIn.\" While rare (< 0.5% avg), shares correlate strongly with brand affinity and organic reach. Track it--and reward sharers with exclusive access or early-bird perks."]}]
3d:["$","hr","83",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
3e:["$","h2","85",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Final Thought: KPIs Are Compasses, Not Destinations"}]
3f:["$","p","87",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Don't chase benchmarks blindly. A 25% open rate means nothing if it drives zero revenue. Start with your business goal:"]}]
40:["$","p","88",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Driving sales? Prioritize ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"RPE + Conversion Rate"}],"."]}]
41:["$","p","89",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Building community? Watch ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"CTR + Sharing Rate + Reply Rate"}],"."]}]
42:["$","p","90",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Nurturing leads? Focus on ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Time-to-Conversion + Engagement Velocity"}]," (how quickly subscribers move from first click to demo request)."]}]
43:["$","p","92",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["And always ask: *What will I change based on this number?* If the answer is \"nothing,\" it's not a KPI--it's noise."]}]
44:["$","p","94",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Measure with purpose. Interpret with context. Act with speed. That's how email transforms from a broadcast channel into your highest-performing growth engine."]}]
